@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Menambahkan Data Semester (Tata Usaha)
actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Semester ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses sidebar "Semester"
UI -> C: 2. Request semester page
C -> DB: 3. Get semester list
DB --> C: 4. Return semester data
C --> UI: 5. Load semester page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan halaman semester

== Tambah Semester Baru ==
TU -> UI: 7. Tampilkan form tambah semester
UI --> TU: 8. Tampilkan form (field Batch - integer)
TU -> UI: 9. Input batch (integer) + klik "Tambah"
UI -> C: 10. Handle form submission

alt Data valid
    C -> C: 10.1. Validate form data
    note right
    - Batch tidak boleh kosong
    - Batch maksimal 2 digit
    end note
    C -> DB: 10.2. Create new semester
    DB --> C: 10.3. Semester created successfully
    C -> DB: 10.4. Get updated semester list
    DB --> C: 10.5. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 10.6. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 10.7. Tampilkan daftar semester terbaru
else Data tidak valid
    C -> C: 10.1. Validate form data
    C --> UI: 10.2. Validation error
    UI --> TU: 10.3. Tampilkan pesan error:
    note right
    - "Formulir Batch harus terisi"
    - "Batch tidak boleh lebih dari 2 digit"
    end note
end
@enduml